Z||000014||Mach10||06-03-2001||07:15 PM||||Ken: We're STILL trying to finish ours. Do yourself a favor and contract out as much as possible. There are SOOOooooo many stupid little things that you WILL forget right up until about 2-1/2 minutes before the building inspector gets there... *shudder*<P>On the other hand, it's lots of fun, and really nifty. Especially in the country. It's not my house but my parents. I still love the place. Something neat about BUILDING your room  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
